WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.413
This video shows how your staff book an appointment for a customer, and

00:00:05.413 --> 00:00:08.852
how they confirm, move, cancel and close appointments.

00:00:08.852 --> 00:00:14.010
It also shows where appointments appear on the calendar, and what each status means.

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:23.342
An appointment is Confirmed when it is booked, or Requested when its appointment

00:00:23.342 --> 00:00:25.708
type waits for someone to confirm it.

00:00:25.708 --> 00:00:30.110
A Held time is kept for a short while for a customer who is still booking.

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:36.789
After the time, an appointment is Completed, or marked No-show when the customer didn't come.

00:00:36.789 --> 00:00:41.520
A cancelled appointment is Cancelled, and a hold that ran out is Expired.

00:00:45.725 --> 00:00:51.130
Open Calendars, Appointment Types and choose Book next to the Ultrasound scan.

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.575
Choose the Day, then Show times.

00:00:54.026 --> 00:00:56.311
The open times are buttons.

00:00:56.311 --> 00:01:01.366
Pick one, then fill in the customer's Name, Email, Phone and Notes.

00:01:03.161 --> 00:01:04.236
Choose Book.

00:01:04.236 --> 00:01:09.074
This type waits for someone to confirm it, so the appointment is Requested.

00:01:09.074 --> 00:01:14.151
If someone took the time a moment before, you are told so and can pick another.

00:01:14.605 --> 00:01:19.284
You can also open Calendars, Appointments and choose Book an appointment.

00:01:19.284 --> 00:01:24.555
There you choose the Appointment type from a list, and the rest works the same way:

00:01:24.555 --> 00:01:27.635
a Day, open times, and the customer's details.

00:01:31.835 --> 00:01:36.670
The appointment's page shows its time, resource, customer, place and notes.

00:01:36.670 --> 00:01:41.505
Below it is the customer's manage link, which you can send to the customer.

00:01:41.957 --> 00:01:44.744
A requested appointment waits for you.

00:01:44.744 --> 00:01:48.417
Choose Confirm, and its status changes to Confirmed.

00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:53.267
Took place and No-show close an appointment once its time has passed, and

00:01:53.267 --> 00:01:56.050
Cancel appointment takes an optional reason.

00:01:56.502 --> 00:02:02.212
To move an appointment, choose another Day, pick one of its open times, and choose Move.

00:02:02.801 --> 00:02:06.508
To cancel it, type a reason and choose Cancel appointment.

00:02:06.508 --> 00:02:10.911
The time is free again, and the appointment can't be changed any more.

00:02:11.363 --> 00:02:18.153
Calendars, Appointments lists every appointment, with a search by customer and a Status filter.

00:02:22.343 --> 00:02:27.139
Every appointment is also an event on the calendar of its resource, tentative

00:02:27.139 --> 00:02:29.219
while it is held or requested.

00:02:29.219 --> 00:02:33.263
Open Calendars, Calendar, and go to the week of the appointment.

00:02:33.715 --> 00:02:38.390
Appointments can only be changed on their own page, not by dragging them

00:02:38.390 --> 00:02:42.525
on the calendar, so the calendar and the bookings always agree.

00:02:46.725 --> 00:02:50.870
When a customer calls to change a time, search for them by name,

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:54.778
open the appointment, and move it to a time that suits them.

00:02:54.778 --> 00:02:58.864
The old time is free again at once, and the next person waiting

00:02:58.864 --> 00:03:00.285
can be offered it.

00:03:01.035 --> 00:03:06.555
For appointment types that wait for confirmation, filter the list by the Requested

00:03:06.555 --> 00:03:10.445
status each morning, and confirm or cancel each request.

00:03:11.195 --> 00:03:16.360
After each visit, mark the appointment Took place, or No-show when the customer

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:19.885
didn't come, so the list shows what really happened.

00:03:21.885 --> 00:03:27.168
Staff can book, confirm, move and cancel appointments from one page, and every

00:03:27.168 --> 00:03:29.370
change shows on the calendar.

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:31.005
Thanks for watching.

